      "content": "i feel like im just in freefall right now. everything i spent twenty years building... the company, the house, the reputation... it's all just gone. i can see the ground coming up so fast and the worst part isnt even the money, its the thought of everyone seeing me like this. just a complete failure. i dont know how i'm supposed to face anyone ever again.",
